# CSSLv3 / SIGIL Upgrade Arc — Manifest

The Upgrade arc is the **frontier map**, not a roadmap. It catalogs the
research-cited design space for CSSLv3 at the asymptote, under the
constraint set: full sovereignty in the limit (no permanent LLVM /
MLIR / Slang dependencies), the PRIME DIRECTIVE as a positive design
constraint (consent-as-OS, capability-secure, AI-as-sovereign-partner,
no surveillance/coercion/manipulation features), solo developer plus
AI fleet, unbounded time horizon.

The thesis is structural: **the frontier is not in any single
dimension but in the orthogonalities that have never been combined.**
Almost every individual component below has a paper or research demo
behind it. The unbuilt region is the cartesian product, executed.

